{
  "schema": "lean-proof-simplification-evidence-v1",
  "source_commit": "2f04c5dcb37ec176f9c141e0ee412baae5e0cfd9",
  "source_parent": "c7b00395db92ac26e8ef9b15309eb164515d7d60",
  "scope": "Share generated native quadratic-row padding proofs",
  "validation": "Paired current-provider target and two client builds pass; client objects are byte-identical. Independent generator regeneration preserves all row data. 100 public and 22 old private type/axiom reports, forced equations, 31,715 global simp entries and 13,981 instances match.",
  "limitations": [
    "Three private helper/generated names are added. The proof uses the current Fin 32 padded-coordinate representation and public Fin/Nat numeral-normalization lemmas.",
    "In one paired repeat, target user CPU was 35.28 seconds baseline and 36.94 candidate; timings are a small local sample. The slower v1 and v2 using Lean internal Fin.induction.go are superseded.",
    "A first textual private-name probe failed parsing; its copied failed source and log are preserved and excluded. The initial archive copied a post-commit generator as baseline and was replaced by the commit-pinned version.",
    "Historical project, Foundation and package inputs remain cached; the archives exclude compiled objects and are not a full closure rebuild."
  ],
